{title: I Feel The Joy Of The Lord}
{key: Gb}
{x_theme: joy, baptism, holy-spirit, jubilee, name-of-jesus, healing}
{x_source: chrd:i_feel_the_joy_of_the_lord.chrd}

{comment: Chorus}
I feel the joy of [Ebm]the Lord falling fresh on me, I feel the joy of the Lord delivering me,
I feel the [Ab]joy of the Holy [Bb]Ghost, all over [Ebm]me.[B5]

{comment: Verse 1}
[Ebm]I'm a little tired of the devil's games, keeping me in bondage to my sorrows and pains,
[Ab]I deserve better, I won't go another day, I'm [Bb]here to claim deliverance in Jesus' name.

{comment: Tag}
[Ebm]I have been loosed, I've been set free,
So pardon me a moment while I have a [Ebm]jubilee,
For the [Ab]joy of the Holy [Bb]Ghost is all over [Ebm]me.
